18
00:01:31.296 --> 00:01:35.601
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Press "Score my screening".

19
00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:41.011
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Coverage first: 20 of 60 screened, as expected for one batch.

20
00:01:41.011 --> 00:01:46.220
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Sensitivity 100% (3 of 3 includes): none missed. Then 4 false includes.

21
00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:49.825
Step 1 done: 20 records in, 20 rows out; Scored: 20 of 60 screened, 0 missed includes.

22
00:01:50.752 --> 00:01:55.762
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/4: Under the score: 0 missed includes, 4 false includes.

23
00:01:55.762 --> 00:02:01.169
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/4: All 4 were excluded by the review only after the full text.

24
00:02:01.169 --> 00:02:05.780
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/4: At title/abstract stage, these are not errors.

25
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:10.784
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/4: Open "Going further": the title/abstract-stage view.

26
00:02:10.784 --> 00:02:15.591
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/4: Stage-view sensitivity 70% (7 of 10): the AI excluded R043, R046 and R054.

27
00:02:15.591 --> 00:02:20.397
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/4: The human screeners had sent those 3 to full text.

28
00:02:20.397 --> 00:02:25.811
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/4: The AI was stricter than the humans: check its excludes too.

29
00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:32.038
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: Open 2 of the 4 false includes: here R050 and R058.

30
00:02:32.038 --> 00:02:36.355
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: On the Records page, batch 3 again.

31
00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:41.360
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: R050: read the abstract, not only the AI's reason.

32
00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:47.168
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: Found: hospital-wide campaign, but infections measured only in the ICU.

33
00:02:47.168 --> 00:02:52.375
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: Decide: "unsure" was fair, C2 really is unclear here.

34
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:57.790
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/4: The review excluded it after the full text: not an error now.

35
00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:02.796
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 4/4: R058: the AI said include, but flagged "check C3".

36
00:03:02.796 --> 00:03:07.802
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 4/4: Found: hospital-wide campaign, its components not described.

37
00:03:07.802 --> 00:03:12.809
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 4/4: Then contact precautions and chlorhexidine bathing were added.

38
00:03:12.809 --> 00:03:18.416
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 4/4: Decide: C3 is in doubt, so "unsure" fits the prompt better.

39
00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:24.029
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 4/4: Either way it goes to full text, where the review excluded it.

40
00:03:24.029 --> 00:03:27.633
Step 2 done: 4 false includes: excluded by the review only after the full text; 3 excludes stricter than the human screeners; Read the abstract, not only the AI's reason.

